<title>USA: Craig Consumer sees lower Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Craig Consumer sees lower Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>CERRITOS, Calif 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Craig Consumer Electronics Inc foresees net income for the third quarter of its 1996 fiscal year totalling about $579,000 against $586,000 for the same period last year, according to a company statement.</p>
<p>The statement said the company's preliminary results for the quarter also projected a sales increase of 6.8 percent to about $25.3 million, compared to $23.7 million last year.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
